{"page":211,"width":1828,"height":2837,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"5.7 운명체x|| 사례들 265","words":[{"text":"5.7","x":1230,"y":177,"width":56,"height":24},{"text":"운명체x||","x":1304,"y":178,"width":95,"height":28},{"text":"사례들","x":1409,"y":178,"width":73,"height":28},{"text":"265","x":1559,"y":173,"width":61,"height":31}]},{"text":"스레드의 초기 우선순위는 보통 스레드가 속한 프로세스의 기본 우선순위가 배정된다.","words":[{"text":"스레드의","x":301,"y":318,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"초기","x":448,"y":318,"width":59,"height":39},{"text":"우선순위는","x":526,"y":318,"width":162,"height":39},{"text":"보통","x":704,"y":319,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"스레드가","x":784,"y":317,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"속한","x":934,"y":316,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스의","x":1018,"y":315,"width":166,"height":40},{"text":"기본","x":1206,"y":316,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"우선순위가","x":1288,"y":315,"width":171,"height":40},{"text":"배정된다.","x":1477,"y":316,"width":144,"height":40}]},{"text":"하지만 Windows API의 SetThreadPriority() 함수를 이용하여 스레드의 기본 우","words":[{"text":"하지만","x":302,"y":383,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"Windows","x":413,"y":385,"width":155,"height":32},{"text":"API의","x":582,"y":383,"width":92,"height":39},{"text":"SetThreadPriority()","x":691,"y":384,"width":377,"height":40},{"text":"함수를","x":1090,"y":382,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"이용하여","x":1206,"y":382,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"스레드의","x":1354,"y":381,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"기본","x":1508,"y":381,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"우","x":1589,"y":382,"width":34,"height":37}]},{"text":"선순위를 변경할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"선순위를","x":303,"y":448,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"변경할","x":446,"y":448,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":552,"y":447,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":597,"y":448,"width":69,"height":38}]},{"text":"스레드의 시간 할당량이 만료되면, 그 스레드는 인터럽트 된다. 그 스레드가 가변 우","words":[{"text":"스레드의","x":363,"y":512,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"시간","x":506,"y":511,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"할당량이","x":581,"y":512,"width":126,"height":39},{"text":"만료되면,","x":724,"y":512,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"그","x":877,"y":517,"width":33,"height":27},{"text":"스레드는","x":923,"y":512,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1072,"y":512,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":1220,"y":512,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1309,"y":517,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"스레드가","x":1356,"y":511,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"가변","x":1509,"y":511,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"우","x":1590,"y":511,"width":35,"height":38}]},{"text":"선순위 클래스에 속한다면 우선순위가 낮아진다. 그러나 우선순위는 기본 우선순위보","words":[{"text":"선순위","x":302,"y":576,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"클래스에","x":416,"y":576,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"속한다면","x":562,"y":576,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"우선순위가","x":710,"y":576,"width":166,"height":40},{"text":"낮아진다.","x":894,"y":576,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"그러나","x":1054,"y":577,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"우선순위는","x":1174,"y":576,"width":172,"height":40},{"text":"기본","x":1365,"y":577,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"우선순위보","x":1449,"y":576,"width":175,"height":39}]},{"text":"다 낮아지지는 않는다. 스레드의 우선순위를 이처럼 낮추게 되면 계산 중심 스레드들이","words":[{"text":"다","x":301,"y":640,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"낮아지지는","x":348,"y":640,"width":162,"height":39},{"text":"않는다.","x":524,"y":641,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"스레드의","x":644,"y":641,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"우선순위를","x":789,"y":641,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"이처럼","x":971,"y":642,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"낮추게","x":1086,"y":642,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"되면","x":1203,"y":642,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"계산","x":1286,"y":641,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"중심","x":1367,"y":642,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"스레드들이","x":1451,"y":641,"width":169,"height":39}]},{"text":"CPU를 독점하는 것을 제한하게 된다. 가변 우선순위 스레드가 대기 연산에서 풀려나면","words":[{"text":"CPU를","x":299,"y":706,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"독점하는","x":423,"y":705,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":568,"y":705,"width":64,"height":38},