:897,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"높여준다.","x":709,"y":898,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"이러한","x":866,"y":898,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"전략은","x":981,"y":899,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"마우스와","x":1094,"y":900,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"원도를","x":1243,"y":900,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"쓰는","x":1358,"y":902,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"대화형","x":1440,"y":900,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"스레","x":1554,"y":900,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"드에 빠른 응답 시간을 허용한다. 계산 중심 스레드에는 후위로 실행되면서 남는 CPU","words":[{"text":"드에","x":298,"y":960,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"빠른","x":379,"y":960,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"응답","x":457,"y":960,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"시간을","x":539,"y":961,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"허용한다.","x":651,"y":961,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"계산","x":810,"y":962,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"중심","x":889,"y":963,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"스레드에는","x":972,"y":963,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"후위로","x":1156,"y":964,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"실행되면서","x":1274,"y":964,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"남는","x":1459,"y":964,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"CPU","x":1541,"y":967,"width":81,"height":31}]},{"text":"사이클을 활용하도록 하면서 I/O 중심 스레드에는 I/O 장치를 바쁘게 만들도록 한다.","words":[{"text":"사이클을","x":298,"y":1024,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"활용하도록","x":443,"y":1025,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"하면서","x":621,"y":1025,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"I/O","x":734,"y":1028,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"중심","x":814,"y":1026,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"스레드에는","x":896,"y":1027,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"I/O","x":1080,"y":1030,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"장치를","x":1163,"y":1028,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"바쁘게","x":1280,"y":1028,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"만들도록","x":1397,"y":1028,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":1546,"y":1027,"width":75,"height":39}]},{"text":"이 전략은 UNIX와 같은 많은 운영체제에서 A卜황된다. 이외에도 현재 사용자가 상호작","words":[{"text":"이","x":299,"y":1089,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"전략은","x":346,"y":1089,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"UNIX와","x":456,"y":1090,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"같은","x":602,"y":1090,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"많은","x":682,"y":1090,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"운영체제에서","x":761,"y":1090,"width":198,"height":39},{"text":"A卜황된다.","x":977,"y":1091,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"이외에도","x":1139,"y":1091,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"현재","x":1290,"y":1092,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"사용자가","x":1371,"y":1091,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"상호작","x":1520,"y":1091,"width":104,"height":38}]},{"text":"펑을 하는 원도는 우선순위를 높게 받아서 응답 시간이 향상된다.","words":[{"text":"펑을","x":297,"y":1153,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"하는","x":376,"y":1153,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"원도는","x":453,"y":1153,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"우선순위를","x":561,"y":1154,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"높게","x":738,"y":1154,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"받아서","x":818,"y":1154,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"응답","x":930,"y":1155,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"시간이","x":1011,"y":1155,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"향상된다.","x":1125,"y":1156,"width":143,"height":38}]},{"text":"사용자가 대화형 프로그램을 실행 중일 때는 시스템은 그 프로세스가 특별히 좋","words":[{"text":"사용자가","x":360,"y":1218,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"대화형","x":510,"y":1218,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"프로그램을","x":626,"y":1218,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"실행","x":814,"y":1219,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"중일","x":897,"y":1219,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"때는","x":984,"y":1220,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"시스템은","x":1071,"y":1219,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1226,"y":1225,"width":35,"height":26},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1278,"y":1220,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"특별히","x":1467,"y":1219,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"좋","x":1589,"y":1221,"width":35,"height":37}]},{"text":"은 성능을 얻도록 해야 한다. 이러한 이유로 Windows는 NORMAL PRIORITY","words":[{"text":"은","x":298,"y":1283,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"성능을","x":349,"y":1283,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"얻도